OL,3,GNEWSAThe cafe that has not changed a
OL,4,Abit since the 1970s
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cafe that has not changed since the
OL,7,F1970s has gone viral online after a
OL,8,Fvisitor posted a video asking if it was
OL,9,Fthe most old fashioned cafe in the
OL,10,Fcountry.
OL,12,FColborne House Cafe, on Wellgate in
OL,13,FClitheroe, Lancashire, is complete with
OL,14,Foriginal features, an unchanged kitchen
OL,15,Fand no music.
OL,17,FThe red vinyl seating, wood panelling
OL,18,Fand Formica tables have been preserved,
OL,19,Fand decorated with lots of memorabilia.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
