OL,3,GNEWSAThe cafe that has not changed a
OL,4,Abit since the 1970s
OL,5,
OL,6,FOwner Gillian Swales said: "It's not
OL,7,Fchanged because we've never needed to,
OL,8,Fit just works for us."
